    you go then, I''ve prepared the pot on the stove already.","parentUIDs":[4],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"S''mon","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":9}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":152,"yPos":443},"ID":7,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"No
    worries, I can give you a recap.","parentUIDs":[5],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"S''mon","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":10}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":159,"yPos":574},"ID":9,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Today,
    instead of me doing the cooking, you''ll be making spaghetti for lunch. You''ll
    need to find three ingredients to put together in the pot. You''ll be looking
    for cheese, uncooked spaghetti and the bolognese sauce.","parentUIDs":[7],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"S''mon","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":11}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":160,"yPos":702},"ID":10,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Search
    for them in the fridge and shelves to your right. However, you can only put in
    the ingredients one at a time.","parentUIDs":[9],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"S''mon","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":12}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":161,"yPos":827},"ID":11,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Once
    you put all three ingredients, we''ll be done! Don''t think too hard about why
    all of them goes into the pot.","parentUIDs":[10],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"S''mon","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":163,"yPos":952},"ID":12,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"All
    you got to remember is pick up the ingredients and put them in the pot and make
